# Anima hackathon context

Before planning or changing this project, read
[`docs/context/README.md`](../../docs/context/README.md) and follow the linked
topic documents. Treat the approved design in
[`docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-12-care-covenant-design.md`](../../docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-12-care-covenant-design.md)
as the source of truth.

Keep the five-hour boundary fixed. Use only synthetic simulator data, keep team
credentials server-side, require human approval for writes, never infer clinical
meaning, and advance state only from current returned evidence. Do not claim
clinical outcomes or deployability that the evidence does not establish.
